---
const bookPath =
  'M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253';
---

<section id="how" class="how container">
  <h2 class="section-title">How it works</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step">
      <div class="art art-end" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mini-bar">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"></path></svg>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h12v18l-6-4.5L6 21z"></path></svg>
          <svg class="mini-book" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={bookPath}></path></svg>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v12M7 8l5-5 5 5M5 14v6h14v-6"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="popover">
          <div class="pop-new"><span>New category...</span><span class="pop-add">Add</span></div>
          <div class="pop-row"><span class="dot" style="background:#1d9bf0"></span>Engineering</div>
          <div class="pop-row"><span class="dot" style="background:#f91880"></span>Design</div>
          <div class="pop-note">Add a note...</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3>1. Save posts as you scroll</h3>
      <p>A book icon sits in every post’s action bar. Click it, pick a category or make a new one, and add a note. Or let X’s own bookmark button save to XMarks.</p>
    </li>

    <li class="step">
      <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="pp">
          <div class="pp-head"><b>XMarks</b><span>Recent saves</span></div>
          <div class="pp-row"><span class="pp-av" style="background:#ffd400"></span><span class="pp-text">hehe</span><span class="pp-badge" style="--c:#ffd400">Memes</span></div>
          <div class="pp-row"><span class="pp-av" style="background:#1d9bf0"></span><span class="pp-text">one does not simply merge to main…</span><span class="pp-badge" style="--c:#1d9bf0">Dev</span></div>
          <div class="pp-open">Open Full Dashboard</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3>2. Check it from the toolbar</h3>
      <p>Click the XMarks icon in Chrome’s toolbar to see your latest saves, then open the full dashboard in one click.</p>
    </li>

    <li class="step">
      <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="search">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"></path></svg>
          rust
        </div>
        <div class="result">Writing a tiny database in <mark>Rust</mark>: pages, B-trees and a WAL.</div>
        <div class="result"><mark>Rust</mark> in production, one year later.</div>
      </div>
      <h3>3. Find it again</h3>
      <p>Search post text, quoted posts, authors, tags and your notes. Sort by hand or let the local model do it. Already have bookmarks on X? Sync them in once.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    padding-top: 96px;
    padding-bottom: 96px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .steps {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .step {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: var(--track-m);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .art {
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .art-end {
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .pp {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-size: 13px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .pp-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .pp-head span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .pp-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 12px;
  }

  .pp-av {
    flex: none;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .pp-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .pp-badge {
    flex: none;
    padding: 0 7px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 45%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 14%, transparent);
    color: var(--c);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pp-open {
    margin: 4px 12px 10px;
    padding: 5px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-contrast);
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .mini-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .mini-book {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .popover {
    width: 220px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .pop-new {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .pop-add {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-contrast);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    padding: 1px 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .pop-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 12px;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .pop-note {
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .search {
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .result {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 8px 4px;
  }

  .result + .result {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  mark {
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0 2px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
